          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "text": "ALBERO AT HOME"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h3",
              "text": "with FP"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image-classic",
          "image": "/images/with-fp/ABR_6206.jpg",
          "alt": "",
          "caption": "",
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Renowned fashion designer Frederick Policarpio walks us through his ideals, interior design vision, and how the environment both provides his source of inspiration while also being a home for comfort."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "gallery",
          "slides": [
            {
              "title": null,
              "description": null,
              "image": "/images/with-fp/ABR_6077.jpg",
              "link": null
            },
            {
              "title": null,
              "description": null,
              "image": "/images/with-fp/ABR_6088.jpg",
              "link": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "“It was always a dream of mine to transform this space into one that echoed my design ideals, extending beyond my work in fashion to shape an environment that feels both personal and timeless.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "gallery",
          "slides": [
